{"type":"standard","title":"Uzbek language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Uzbek language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q9264","titles":{"canonical":"Uzbek_language","normalized":"Uzbek language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Uzbek language</span></span>"},"pageid":71836,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Uzbek.svg/330px-Uzbek.svg.png","width":330,"height":327},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Uzbek.svg/3840px-Uzbek.svg.png","width":2576,"height":2549},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1354164073","tid":"893e315d-4fc2-11f1-8e0e-13ec864c38ad","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:27:17Z","description":"Karluk Turkic language","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uzbek_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uzbek_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uzbek_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Uzbek_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uzbek_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Uzbek_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uzbek_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Uzbek_language"}},"extract":"Uzbek is a Karluk Turkic language spoken by Uzbeks. It is the official and national language of Uzbekistan and formally succeeded Chagatai, an earlier Karluk language endonymically called Türki or Türkçe, as the literary language of Uzbekistan in the 1920s.","extract_html":"<p><b>Uzbek</b> is a Karluk Turkic language spoken by Uzbeks. It is the official and national language of Uzbekistan and formally succeeded Chagatai, an earlier Karluk language endonymically called <span><i lang=\"xqa\">Türki</i></span> or <span><i lang=\"xqa\">Türkçe</i></span>, as the literary language of Uzbekistan in the 1920s.</p>"}